Package: evanxlsx
Type: Package
Title: Simple Table Import, Export and Processing
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: person("Evan", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "104670239+lianglunping@users.noreply.github.com")
Author: Evan [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Evan <104670239+lianglunping@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Imports and exports XLSX, TXT, TSV and CSV through two
    simple functions, with formatted Excel output and file protection. Optional 'polars' helpers provide
    numeric summaries, non-destructive interquartile-range flags, strict text
    splitting and key validation through Tidy column selection. Does not
    upload data or install packages during use. Existing exports do not
    require the optional data-processing dependencies.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
